Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Final Episode\N {\fs100}Movie Night {映画鑑賞の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Be quiet, won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.18,0:00:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder is ill, so quit roaming about \Nand crying in a weird voice!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.52,0:01:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how unusual. {?????}{珍しい?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.10,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he looking, everyone?\NHas it started already?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.52,0:01:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. He's only now entering a coma. {im not even joking, she says 昏睡状態}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.17,0:01:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, don't you think his fever \Nis still not high enough?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.57,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, his fever is climbing up little by little. Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, he's in the condition! \NTime to bring the projector.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.33,0:01:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn off the lights.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.99,0:01:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't wait{ any longer}!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.13,0:01:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The picture is still rather muddy...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give him some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.52,0:01:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Quite a beauty! \NI wonder who that is.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.51,0:02:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Yang Guifei! {?????????????????? no clue}{楊貴妃}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.21,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Somebody, come here! Somebody! {???? maybe "Who's there?"}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.41,0:02:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.45,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My... Are you today's bathhouse attendant? {三助}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.95,0:02:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll take care of your back. Now, now...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.91,0:02:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.43,0:02:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.23,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been calling you for a while,\Ndidn't you hear?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that should be enough. {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.48,0:02:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, sorry for making you wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.16,0:02:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My, oh my.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's angry!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.16,0:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards! Guards! \NExecute this man immediately! {lit: is there someone}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.70,0:02:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're executing him.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Elder...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.87,0:02:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a cruel fate...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.77,0:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,At the emperor's order, \Nthis man will be executed!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.35,0:03:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you prepared yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.69,0:03:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's done for.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.41,0:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.99,0:03:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.35,0:03:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't cut his head.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.20,0:03:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're eddoes. \NWhat are they going to do? {taro (Colocasia esculenta); dasheen; eddo​}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.96,0:03:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,For your crime, you're sentenced to peel all those eddoes! {probably a play on the fact that the main meaning of shokei is executed but it also means just "punished"}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.31,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits him so well!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.16,0:04:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't stand this itching.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.83,0:04:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Itchy! Itchy! Itchy! Itchy!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, another one began.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and now it's in Egypt.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Cleopatra!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, turns out our Elder \Ncan be pretty ambitious too!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, our Elder's always aiming high. {??? lit: only big things}{first was Yang Guifei, now Cleopatra, so yeah}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.02,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's Caesar! How handsome!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.03,0:04:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it you they call Elder?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.95,0:04:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my Caesar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.91,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Caesar, the manly Caesar.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.00,0:05:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no use for that man anymore. \NKill him, he's but a hindrance.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.88,0:05:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know—\Nhe gets executed again.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.80,0:05:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? So he's done for, after all?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Elder.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what is he going to do now?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, poor Elder!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.15,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cobra! No...!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.08,0:05:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! {\i1}Now{\i0} he's done for.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.58,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, poor Elder!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.08,0:05:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No way out now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Salty! {ig ???}{塩っぱい but with e}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.98,0:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose Elder has a rather foul taste.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.47,0:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it this time?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.77,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a nice silhouette!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.16,0:06:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! It gets the blood flowing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.62,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My, isn't that King David?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.16,0:06:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Hermit Elder!\NI love you! Don't you understand? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.39,0:06:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, please, climb up here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.47,0:06:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That, I can't do.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.81,0:06:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.76,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,King, I can't feel at ease. \NPlease, make him mine, and mine alone! {?????????????}{"I feel like I'm going to lose my mind"}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.46,0:06:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of that ugly old hermit for good!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.03,0:06:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now he's done for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.00,0:06:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, women sure are scary creatures.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a rather ugly dish.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.25,0:07:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, you're mine, and mine alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.68,0:07:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just my way of loving you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.44,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, this is also my way of loving! {she's perfect}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.74,0:07:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's nothing but a head on a plate. Elder has it hard. {????????}{"he won't be heard for being just a head on a plate"}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.97,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No neck... No neck! My neck...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.64,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you threw the projector off. \NHere you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.70,0:07:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I wonder what comes next.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's a bullring!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lovely, darling.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Carmen!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's aiming big again!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.92,0:08:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.26,0:08:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a bullfighter too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.66,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was just an illusion.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he died?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.74,0:09:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, you got stabbed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see where this is going!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.03,0:09:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.31,0:09:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see what you mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are all the same!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.52,0:09:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe it's about time for a break? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.52,0:09:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.25,0:09:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.23,0:09:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting again.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.69,0:09:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.97,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew! What a juicy pair of legs!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to keep yourself safe this time, won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.49,0:09:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's Al Capone!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.09,0:10:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, withdraw now!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.98,0:10:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it seems he won't be safe, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.14,0:10:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.69,0:10:22.14,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Yes, now, now...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.14,0:10:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take it off now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.32,0:10:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's him!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.74,0:10:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's for dragging my honor through the mud! {??????????? something about his face}{because he's sleeping with his wife}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.87,0:10:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.83,0:10:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, somebody!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.96,0:10:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.92,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and what are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.30,0:10:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be training!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.81,0:11:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's the end of our movie nights too. {probably a commentary on the end of this show}{you know, good ending}
